		// that open *inside* the quoted span — otherwise the inner
		// `"..."` of a $() argument closes the outer quote prematurely
		// (the heredoc-inside-$()-inside-"" pattern from
		// `git commit -m "$(cat <<'EOF' ... \"TOKEN\" ... EOF)"`).
